{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"```systemverilog\nmodule comparator_3bit (\n    input  logic [2:0] A,\n    input  logic [2:0] B,\n    output logic       A_greater,\n    output logic       A_equal,\n    output logic       A_less\n);\n\n    always_comb begin\n        A_greater = 1'b0;\n        A_equal   = 1'b0;\n        A_less    = 1'b0;\n\n        if (A > B)\n            A_greater = 1'b1;\n        else if (A == B)\n            A_equal = 1'b1;\n        else\n            A_less = 1'b1;\n    end\n\nendmodule\n```"}}
